{"id":"ravno","lemma":"равно","pos":"adv","rank":208,"glosses":["equally, as well, as well as"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0a/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Почему тебе всё равно?","en":"Why don't you care?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Я знаю, что вам всё равно.","en":"I know that you don't care.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Мой план всё равно лучше твоего.","en":"My plan is still better than yours.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"plan , scheme"},{"g":"everything, all"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"}]},{"text":"Делай что хочешь, мне всё равно.","en":"Do what you want. It doesn't matter to me.","words":[{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Она всё равно хотела пойти.","en":"She wanted to go out anyway.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"everything, all"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to go"}]}]}